message: "If you use HealthGraphBench, please cite the repository and the versioned benchmark contract."
title: "HealthGraphBench"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible temporal benchmark for studying when relational information
  adds predictive value beyond strong entity-local and relational baselines in
  public health and regulatory machine learning.
